title: $:/mf/gen/CLI command/mf gui view
catalog: CLI command
target: mf gui view
summary: Print or set the panel type shown in a slot

!! Reference

```
Print or set the panel type shown in a slot

Usage: mf gui view [OPTIONS] <SLOT> [PANEL_TYPE]

Arguments:
  <SLOT>
          Slot name (left or right)

  [PANEL_TYPE]
          Panel type to set (omit to print the current one)

Options:
      --path <PATH>
          File path (file panel type)

  -h, --help
          Print help
```
